# Secret Chats API Testing
# Use this file with REST Client extension in VS Code or similar HTTP client

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@userId1 = 1
@userId2 = 2
@userId3 = 3

### 1. Create a Secret Chat
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/secret-chats
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pregnancy Support Group",
  "description": "A safe space to share experiences and get support",
  "isGroup": true,
  "memberIds": [2, 3]
}

### 2. Get User's Chats (Test endpoint)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/secret-chats/test/user/{{userId1}}

### 3. Create a Post with Text Content
# Replace {chatId} with actual chat ID from step 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/secret-chats/test/chat/{chatId}/user/{{userId1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Hello everyone! Just wanted to share that I'm 20 weeks pregnant now! 🤱",
  "isAnonymous": false
}

### 4. Create an Anonymous Post
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/secret-chats/test/chat/{chatId}/user/{{userId2}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Has anyone experienced morning sickness that lasts all day? Looking for advice...",
  "isAnonymous": true
}

### 5. Get Chat Posts
# Replace {chatId} with actual chat ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/secret-chats/{chatId}/posts?page=1&limit=10

### 6. Like a Post
# Replace {postId} with actual post ID from previous steps
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/secret-chats/posts/{postId}/like

### 7. Create a Comment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/secret-chats/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Congratulations! That's so exciting! 🎉",
  "postId": "{postId}",
  "isAnonymous": false
}

### 8. Reply to a Comment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/secret-chats/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Thank you so much! I'm really excited too!",
  "postId": "{postId}",
  "parentId": "{commentId}",
  "isAnonymous": false
}

### 9. Get Post Comments
# Replace {postId} with actual post ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/secret-chats/posts/{postId}/comments?page=1&limit=20

### 10. Send a Text Message
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/secret-chats/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Hey everyone! Just joined the group 👋",
  "chatId": "{chatId}",
  "messageType": "TEXT"
}

### 11. Get Chat Messages
# Replace {chatId} with actual chat ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/secret-chats/{chatId}/messages?page=1&limit=50

### 12. Add a New Member to Chat
# Replace {chatId} with actual chat ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/secret-chats/{chatId}/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 4,
  "role": "MEMBER"
}

### 13. Update Chat Information
# Replace {chatId} with actual chat ID
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/secret-chats/{chatId}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pregnancy Support & Tips",
  "description": "Updated description: A supportive community for expectant mothers"
}

### 14. Upload Media for Post (Form Data)
# This would be used with a file upload
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/secret-chats/posts/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="ultrasound.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./path/to/your/image.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary--

### 15. Create Post with Media
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/secret-chats/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Here's my latest ultrasound photo!",
  "chatId": "{chatId}",
  "isAnonymous": false,
  "media": [
    {
      "url": "http://localhost:3000/uploads/posts/filename.jpg",
      "type": "IMAGE",
      "caption": "20-week ultrasound"
    }
  ]
}

### 16. Mark Message as Read
# Replace {messageId} with actual message ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/secret-chats/messages/{messageId}/read

### 17. Leave Chat
# Replace {chatId} with actual chat ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/secret-chats/{chatId}/leave

### 18. Remove Member from Chat
# Replace {chatId} and {userId} with actual IDs
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/secret-chats/{chatId}/members/{userId}

###
